{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3147200/extras/_1.gif?t=1743844478\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Each floor is new experience. <strong>Solve intricate puzzles</strong>, <strong>complete quests</strong>, <strong>search\u00a0for tools</strong>. Be careful\u2014there are traps, scary creatures, and surprises around every corner. Stay sharp, work with your friends, and push deeper into the unknown.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3147200/extras/low_res.gif?t=1743844478\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3147200/extras/they-can-hear-you.gif?t=1743844478\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Some of them can hear even the slightest sound, so be careful. Watch the noise you make, and don\u2019t speak too loudly when they\u2019re near.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3147200/extras/gif4.gif?t=1743844478\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3147200/extras/_2.gif?t=1743844478\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Ask somone to help you , it's better to not go alone . The danger is always there , and it's better to handle it\u00a0 together.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3147200?t=1743844478","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3147200?t=1743844478","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3147200/88ba3fe9968a24a1d26dce1e44826b3bfd665dac/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1743844478","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.ak